<title>JAPAN: Daishinku - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daishinku - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 16.12		vs	   14.76</p>
<p> Operating	    1.17		vs	    1.22</p>
<p> Current		1.93		vs	    1.09</p>
<p> Net		  901 million	 vs	  492 million</p>
<p> EPS		   22.39 yen	  vs	   13.12 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     40 million	  vs	  38 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.50 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Daishinku Corp is a specialist manufacturer of crystal resonators.</p>
